<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges up to 1.8160 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges up to 1.8160 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8160 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8180 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  May 7		May 6</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8160	     1.8180</p>
<p> Volume traded			$10.23 million	 $25.81 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
